+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-4" id="question-4">
+          <span>How often should a litter box be cleaned?</span>
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-4" hidden>
+          <div class="details-inner">
+            <p>Scoop the litter box at least once a day and replace the litter on a regular schedule. Many cats prefer one box per cat, plus one extra box.</p>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-5" id="question-5">
+          <span>Why does my cat purr?</span>
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-5" hidden>
+          <div class="details-inner">
+            <p>Cats commonly purr when they are content, but they may also purr to self-soothe when stressed or uncomfortable. Look at the whole body language for context.</p>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+    </section>
+  </main>
+
+  <script>
